#Required Parameters
mu  752.768
rho 493.936
KB  0.008313
T  298.15
EulerianType Eulerian_Period       #Only this type is supported.
LagrangianType Lagrangian_LAMMPS    #Only this type is supported.
nsteps 20000000                 #please remove the run and fixSELM statements from the LAMMPS input script.

#Optional Parameters
flagStochasticDriving 1       #If the parameter is not provided, the default value is 0.
SELM_Seed 7324            #If flagStochasticDriving is 1, but the SELM_Seed parameter is not provided, then SELM_Seed is initialized using the system's random seed.
numMeshPtsPerDir 24 24 24    #In this program, it is assumed that the DeltaX is the same in each dimension, therefore numMeshPtsPerDir should be the same in every dimension.
